  <body>
    <main class="home-page">
      <h1 class="home-page__title">Welcome to the Village of Somerset Glen</h1>
      <hr class="rainbow-rule">
      <div class="home-page__body">
        <p>
          Nestled along the edge of beautiful Preservation Park in the south end of Guelph,
          the Village of Somerset Glen is an established community of 74 freehold townhomes
          distinguished by its timeless colonial architecture, beautifully maintained landscape,
          and enduring sense of pride in ownership.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since its creation, Somerset Glen has been more than a collection of homes—it has
          been a carefully planned managed community. A comprehensive Maintenance Agreement and
          Building Scheme have helped preserve the neighbourhood's architectural integrity,
          coordinated appearance, and attractive streetscape while protecting the qualities that
          make Somerset Glen a desirable place to live.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every homeowner contributes through a monthly maintenance fee that provides professional
          lawn care for the grounds of each individual residential unit as well as the community's
          shared lands, together with snow removal and the maintenance and upkeep of the clubhouse
          and other shared property. This coordinated approach helps maintain a consistent and
          attractive appearance throughout the Village.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ownership in Somerset Glen also includes membership in the Somerset Neighbourhood Club,
          the non-profit corporation responsible for maintaining the community's shared assets and
          administering the Maintenance Agreement and Building Scheme for the benefit of all
          homeowners.
        </p>
        <p>
          For more than a quarter century, the Village of Somerset Glen has combined the
          independence of freehold home ownership with the advantages of a thoughtfully maintained
          community—creating an attractive, welcoming neighbourhood where residents can enjoy both
          the beauty of their surroundings and the confidence that comes from preserving a shared
          vision.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
